  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fintech for WEE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x201c;Fintech for Women&#x2019;s Economic Empowerment&#x201d; project seeks to enhance the economic empowerment of women working in the green sector in Jordan, which is estimated to be around 18% , by expanding their access to finance and financial inclusion support tools. The UNDP will focus its efforts on facilitating the availability of gender-responsive financial and non-financial products, to foster women&#x2019;s engagement in the green economy, increase their access to resources, and dismantle structural barriers impeding their full integration into the labour market, especially those linked to financial providers and financial institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
